@harrisonhulker5711 Socialism is simple as this:  Labor is entitled to the fruit of their production.  

Get rid of the rent-seekers motivations to park their cash in assets; driving up the costs of basic standards of living.

Need an example?  Workers do not only earn a wage, but a percentage of the profits; because as the economists put it:  "We're so much more productive,".

